    "买家付款后钱由平台代收，确认收货后扣除手续费记入卖家余额。卖家超时未发货自动退款，买家超时未确认自动结算，有争议可以申请平台介入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The platform holds the buyer's payment and, once receipt is confirmed, pays the seller's balance minus the fee. If the seller doesn't ship in time the buyer is refunded; if the buyer doesn't confirm in time the order settles. Either side can ask the platform to step in on a dispute."
