          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletion can't be undone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "注销后账号资料会被清空，所有登录失效，关注和屏蔽关系、一对一私信会被删除，并退出群聊和频道。你发过的主题和回复会保留，署名变为已注销的账号。此操作立即生效，不可撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deleting clears your profile, signs you out everywhere, removes your follows, blocks and direct messages, and takes you out of group chats and channels. Your topics and replies stay, signed as a deleted account. This takes effect immediately and can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
